  "description": "Superbly located in the heart of Castleknock Village, this beautifully presented two-bedroom terraced home is fully furnished to a high standard and set within a quiet, well-established residential estate.\n\nThe property benefits from off-street parking and is within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants and public transport. Castleknock Train Station is just a five-minute walk away, while the M50 and N3 are easily accessible, making it an ideal location for commuting.\n\nA stylish and comfortable home in one of Dublin’s most sought-after residential areas.",
